WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.540
- [Kelly] Welcome to we live (indistinct).

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.910
So do you remember when
you first moved here?

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:04.743
- I do.

00:00:04.743 --> 00:00:09.680
It was in, I think 2003.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.150
I've been here for a long time,

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.900
and when I first moved out here,

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.570
I moved with two of my girlfriends.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.300
Cause we were like, we don't
have any responsibilities.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.510
We should try LA.

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:18.717
And one of them had been an intern at,

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:20.400
- (laughing) I love that plan

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.460
- It was a great plan,

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.790
and one of them had been an
intern at, in a set department

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:28.160
at SNL, and Chris Kattan,

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.417
they had become friends and he was like,

00:00:29.417 --> 00:00:31.070
"you can stay in my pool house",

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:32.930
and the other two of us
didn't have anywhere to stay,

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.840
so we just like secretly
would go in and out

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:36.820
the back of his pool house.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.990
That was like our housing
for the first three months.

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:40.850
And I don't think he knew, well, I mean,

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.030
he probably knows now.

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:42.870
- Oh my gosh

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:43.777
- [Kristen] But yeah.
That's where we stayed.

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.820
- So you just snuck up on his property.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:46.653
I love that

00:00:46.653 --> 00:00:47.670
- [Chris] I knew it

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:48.781
- I knew it this whole time.

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:50.103
- [Kelly] (laughing)

00:00:50.103 --> 00:00:50.936
- [Kristen] (laughing)

00:00:50.936 --> 00:00:51.769
- [Kelly] (clapping hands)

00:00:51.769 --> 00:00:52.602
- (audience clapping)

00:00:52.602 --> 00:00:55.768
- [Kelly] Chris Kattan everybody.

00:00:55.768 --> 00:00:56.601
- [Kristen] - You.

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.270
- [Chris] You.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.820
You.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.610
- You, Kay Bell,

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:02.472
or whatever they call you.

00:01:02.472 --> 00:01:03.305
- (laughing)

00:01:03.305 --> 00:01:05.017
- [Chris] You owe me,

00:01:05.017 --> 00:01:07.344
$322 and 27 cents.

00:01:07.344 --> 00:01:10.987
- [Kristen] (Laughing)

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:12.110
- Could you tell me.

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:15.930
Could you tell me which
way to the Judge Judy set?

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:16.763
- Its over that way.

00:01:16.763 --> 00:01:17.596
Okay.

00:01:17.596 --> 00:01:18.429
I got my eye on you.

00:01:18.429 --> 00:01:19.267
- [Kristen] (laughing)

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:20.272
- [Kelly] (laughing)

00:01:20.272 --> 00:01:23.670
- (audience clapping)

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:24.924
- [Kristen] I love you.

00:01:24.924 --> 00:01:25.757
- [Kelly] He is like (laughing).

00:01:25.757 --> 00:01:27.174
He is like, What?

